&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a customer-facing technical role, such as solutions architecture, sales engineering, developer relations, or technical enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
